# expected to match nothing.
1CLAUDE.md

# Project notes and the portable memory copy — local only. Trailing slash, so
# nothing inside can be un-ignored by a later negation; that is intended. To
# publish one file out it would have to become `docs/*` plus `!docs/<file>`.
docs/

